  "prefLabel": "Adm 604.08 Bid Invitation(s)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 604.08 Bid Invitation(s).\n\nUnless an alternate document is specified in the requirements of the bid, a bid shall be submitted according to Adm 604.09. A bidder shall submit in writing and shall include all sheets, sides, or pages of the bid invitation provided by the division which sets forth or incorporates the applicable general terms, conditions, and provisions.\n\nSource. #8310, eff 5-11-05; ss by #10364, eff 7-1-13; amd by #10827, eff 5-16-15; ss by #13708, eff 7-29-23 (formerly Adm 604.07) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 600)",
